      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3224,
      "text": "Say, “No one in the heavens and earth has knowledge of the unseen except Allah.” Nor do they know when they will be resurrected.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 383,
      "ruku": 331,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3225,
      "text": "In fact, their knowledge cannot comprehend the Hereafter; rather, they are in doubt about it; rather, they are blind to it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 383,
      "ruku": 331,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3226,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve say, “What! Is it that when we and our forefathers become dust, will we really be brought forth [alive]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 383,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3227,
      "text": "We and our forefathers have been promised this before; this is nothing but ancient fables!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 383,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3228,
      "text": "Say, “Travel in the land and see how was the end of the wicked.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 383,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3229,
      "text": "Do not grieve over them, nor be distressed by their plots.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 20,
